  <div class="section no-top-padding"><div class="container"><div class="hero4 hero-content-centered"><div class="subtitle">January 21, 2023</div><h1>10 Best Swimming Holes at (and around) Toile Blanche</h1></div></div></div><div class="full-frame-image-wrapper" style='background-image:url("https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/639af6c370637a84eae3b0bb/63dba6734593ea2951d0c2e5_kenta-kariya-98h5J6sONcE-unsplash.jpg")'></div><div class="section"><div class="container"><div class="blog-post w-richtext"><p>La Plage des Six Pins: A beautiful sandy beach located just a short drive from Hotel Toile Blanche. This beach is known for its clear waters, making it a perfect spot for swimming and snorkeling.</p><p>La Plage de la Gaillarde: This secluded beach offers crystal clear waters and a beautiful rocky coastline, perfect for a refreshing swim.</p><p>La Plage des Oursinières: This beach is known for its calm waters, making it a great spot for swimming and relaxing.</p><p>‍</p><figure class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image" style="max-width:5804pxpx"><div><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-f1d04836c30567.jpg"/></div></figure><p>‍</p><p>La Plage de la Croisette: A popular beach located in Cannes, known for its fine sandy beaches and crystal clear waters, perfect for swimming and sunbathing.</p><p>La Plage de la Garoupe: This beach is located in the exclusive town of Antibes and offers a more peaceful swimming experience.</p><p>La Plage de la Salis: This secluded beach offers crystal clear waters and a beautiful rocky coastline, perfect for swimming and snorkeling.</p><p>La Plage de l'Estagnol: This beach is located in the town of Saint-Tropez and offers a more lively atmosphere with a variety of water sports available.</p><p>‍</p><figure class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image" style="max-width:5184px"><div><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-46f3869751fa73.jpg"/></div></figure><p>‍</p><p>La Plage de la Bouillabaisse: This beach is known for its clear waters and beautiful rocky coastline, perfect for swimming and snorkeling.</p><p>La Plage de la Moutte: This beach is located in the exclusive town of Saint-Jean-Cap-Ferrat and offers a more peaceful swimming experience.</p><p>La Plage de la Pointe Croisette: This beach is located in Cannes and offers a more lively atmosphere with a variety of water sports available.</p><p>‍</p><p>These are just a few of the many swimming holes available in the area surrounding Hotel Toile Blanche. Whether you're looking for a peaceful and secluded spot or a more lively beach scene, the French Riviera offers something for everyone. Book your stay at Hotel Toile Blanche and discover the beauty and culture of the region, all while enjoying a refreshing swim in the Mediterranean Sea.</p><p>‍</p></div></div></div><div class="section no-top-padding"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper inner-spacing div-block"><h2>Continue reading</h2></div></div><div class="container no-padding-mobile"><div class="blog-collection-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div class="blog-flex-thirds w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="blog-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="collection-link-block w-inline-block" href="best-places-to-eat-the-tastiest-local-food-around-toile-blanche.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Best places to eat the tastiest local food around Toile Blanche" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-0bd0acfefc8c5b.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle">Best places to eat the tastiest local food around Toile Blanche</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="blog-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="collection-link-block w-inline-block" href="self-guided-tour-itinarary.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="A self-gu